sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Instructor
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as AssignmentController
  participant Service as AssignmentService
  participant Course as CourseAccessService
  participant Repo as AssignmentSubmissionRepository
  participant Notify as NotificationService

  Instructor->>Web: Grade submission
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/assignment-submissions/{submissionId}/grade
  Api->>Service: gradeSubmission(instructorId, request)
  Service->>Course: Require course owner or admin permission
  Service->>Repo: Load submission
  Service->>Repo: Save score and feedback
  Service->>Notify: Notify student
  Service-->>Api: GradingResponse
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Instructor: Show saved grade
